                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And to love God with all your heart and with all your mind and with all your strength, and to love your neighbour as yourself, is more important than to offer animals and other sacrifices to God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.33",
